        "sub": "Om Jai Lakshmi Mata • ॐ जय लक्ष्मी माता, मैया जय",
        "thumb": "assets/gallery/bal_durga.jpg",
        "audio_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oec7CXRAfeE",
