        "sub": "Jai Ahoi Mata, Jai Ahoi Mata • जय अहोई माता, जय अहोई माता",
        "thumb": "assets/gallery/bal_durga.jpg",
        "audio_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcVv68gwc5Y",
